[SPEAKER_01]: You keep taking it for granted.

246
00:22:12,748 --> 00:22:16,229
[SPEAKER_03]: So, then, you were asking, like, so, how do you disassociate stuff?

247
00:22:16,509 --> 00:22:23,132
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, so, how do you disassociate the images that want to take the center stage?

